{
  "chapterId": 87,
  "translation": {
    "source": "QuranEnc.com",
    "sourceUrl": "https://quranenc.com/en/home/api",
    "title": "English Translation - Noor International Center",
    "version": "1.1.2"
  },
  "verses": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "arabicText": " سَبِّحِ ٱسْمَ رَبِّكَ ٱلْأَعْلَى",
      "englishText": "Exalt the name of your Lord, the Most High,",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "arabicText": "ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ فَسَوَّىٰ",
      "englishText": "Who created and proportioned",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "arabicText": "وَٱلَّذِى قَدَّرَ فَهَدَىٰ",
      "englishText": "And who destined and [then] guided",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "arabicText": "وَٱلَّذِىٓ أَخْرَجَ ٱلْمَرْعَىٰ",
      "englishText": "And who brings out the pasture",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "arabicText": "فَجَعَلَهُۥ غُثَآءً أَحْوَىٰ",
      "englishText": "And [then] makes it black stubble.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "arabicText": "سَنُقْرِئُكَ فَلَا تَنسَىٰٓ",
      "englishText": "We will make you recite, [O Muḥammad], and you will not forget,",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "arabicText": "إِلَّا مَا شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ يَعْلَمُ ٱلْجَهْرَ وَمَا يَخْفَىٰ",
      "englishText": "Except what Allāh should will. Indeed, He knows what is declared and what is hidden.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "arabicText": "وَنُيَسِّرُكَ لِلْيُسْرَىٰ",
      "englishText": "And We will ease you toward ease.[1907]",
      "footnotes": "[1907] To the path of Allāh's religion, which is easy and natural, or toward Paradise, by giving opportunities for righteous deeds.",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "arabicText": "فَذَكِّرْ إِن نَّفَعَتِ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰ",
      "englishText": "So remind, if the reminder should benefit;[1908]",
      "footnotes": "[1908] i.e., wherever it will be heard and understood.",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "arabicText": "سَيَذَّكَّرُ مَن يَخْشَىٰ",
      "englishText": "He who fears [Allāh] will be reminded.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "arabicText": "وَيَتَجَنَّبُهَا ٱلْأَشْقَى",
      "englishText": "But the wretched one will avoid it –",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "arabicText": "ٱلَّذِى يَصْلَى ٱلنَّارَ ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ",
      "englishText": "[He] who will [enter and] burn in the greatest Fire,",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "arabicText": "ثُمَّ لَا يَمُوتُ فِيهَا وَلَا يَحْيَىٰ",
      "englishText": "Neither dying therein nor living.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "arabicText": "قَدْ أَفْلَحَ مَن تَزَكَّىٰ",
      "englishText": "He has certainly succeeded who purifies himself",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "arabicText": "وَذَكَرَ ٱسْمَ رَبِّهِۦ فَصَلَّىٰ",
      "englishText": "And mentions the name of his Lord and prays.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "arabicText": "بَلْ تُؤْثِرُونَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنْيَا",
      "englishText": "But you prefer the worldly life,",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "arabicText": "وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةُ خَيْرٌ وَأَبْقَىٰٓ",
      "englishText": "While the Hereafter is better and more enduring.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 18,
      "arabicText": "إِنَّ هَـٰذَا لَفِى ٱلصُّحُفِ ٱلْأُولَىٰ",
      "englishText": "Indeed, this is in the former scriptures,",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 19,
      "arabicText": "صُحُفِ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَمُوسَىٰ",
      "englishText": "The scriptures of Abraham and Moses.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/087019.mp3"
    }
  ]
}
